        "en": "Put your hand in front of your mouth!"
      }
    },
    {
      "niveau": "B2",
      "satz": "Sie hielt ihm vor, dass er nie pünktlich sei, obwohl sie selbst oft zu spät kam.",
      "uebersetzung": {
        "fa": "به او سرکوفت زد که هیچ‌وقت سر وقت نیست، با اینکه خودش اغلب دیر می‌آمد.",
        "en": "She reproached him for never being on time, although she herself was often late."
      }
    }
